proposal.aa:
Duration and delay collapse to 0 under prefers-reduced-motion (matchMedia check in
        script, per the spec's S3 contract); static end-state is the filtered grid itself;
        no content is motion-gated.

Static fallback is the flat card (S6 contract); reduced-motion holds flat;
        focus-within parity means keyboard users get the same affordance; text layers remain
        AA-contrast at rest and in tilt (no opacity change on text).
